# Embedded App Navigation

Client-side navigation in the embedded admin must keep `shop`, `host`, and `embedded` query params or routes can return a blank HTTP 200.

- Use `AppLink` instead of React Router `Link` for `/app/*` destinations.
- Use `useAppNavigate()` instead of `useNavigate()` for programmatic `/app/*` navigation.
- Use `useAppPath()` for `s-button href`, `fetcher.submit({ action })`, and other string paths.
- `AppNavLink` in `app/routes/app.tsx` already handles main nav the same way.
